    <td style="padding:10px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;color:#6b7280;font-size:14px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;width:40%">종료 요청 사유</td>
